BODY = "From Batch 30's production measurements (ADR 0019): each database command cost about 145 ms, and measure() sent seven one after another, about a second of each reminder run; they now go out together. Starting a bot, a new connection and getMe, cost 0.8 to 1 s, and every webhook update, reminder run and background message started one; the app now starts one bot at start-up, with eight connections so senders at the same moment do not queue, and every sender uses it, falling back to its own when none was started. Tests prove the commands are in flight together and the bot is made once, without timing. The harness guard now also finds senders that hand their Bot to the helper."
